From 240998f587009191d69eb34233db0682cf6e7e21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: duckfamily <156525766+duckfamily@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 02:33:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] Wire the new subsystems into Application

Registers the new sources, starts the proxy feed, prunes expired entries
before the network is consulted, and shuts the wallpaper down before the
global clip subsystem during teardown.

considerProxyFallback keys on Account::mtpExists() rather than
sessionExists(). The person this is for is most likely sitting on the login
screen unable to authorise precisely because nothing gets through, and
requiring a session would have skipped them entirely - which made the whole
fallback dead code for its own main case.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
